{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "eeb8d053-b7a7-8132-9257-c6784a440d0d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-07T09:43:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Yes, I am calling because of the snow. Is this the right number? I know City Hall is closed today, it is Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place. The storm line is open when City Hall isn't. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:41:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I live at 11 Brewer Street, in the Fifth Ward. The street, nobody plowed it. It is only a little snow, a dusting, but it is very cold. Everything is ice under it. [pause] Sorry, I am folding laundry. One, two, three... okay, three pairs. Go on, I am listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, fold away. So Brewer Street hasn't been touched at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:41:48-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Not one time. I look out the window since six o'clock. My neighbor, she is very old, she lives next door. She cannot go out. She needs a path to the street, for the walking, and for the car if someone comes to help her. I am frustrated, because this is happening again. Every time, we are the last."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:42:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, and I'm sorry. With a light snow on top of a hard freeze, the crews are treating the main roads first, then the side streets. Brewer would be in that second round."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:42:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The second round. So when? When it will be cleared? Please say again slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Main roads first, then side streets like yours. I'd say sometime this afternoon is realistic. I'll put in a note that there's an elderly resident on the street who can't get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:42:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. This afternoon. Four, five, six... six socks, no, seven. [pause] Sorry. Yes, afternoon. And you write the note for my neighbor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:42:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm writing it right now. Can I get a callback number in case dispatch needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:42:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0174. Eleven Brewer Street, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:43:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, eleven. Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All set, Ms. Souza. Stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T09:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
